'''The''' '''Imperial medical laboratory'''<ref name="Deke DB">{{Databank|deke|Deke}}</ref> was a [[laboratory]] on the [[planet]] [[Setron]]. The facility was overseen by [[Doctor]] [[Royce Hemlock]] and was involved with his experiments, which involved drawing blood from [[clone cadet]]s that were transferred from [[Kamino]] and held as prisoners. It also was the site of the creation of the [[slither vine]], an experimental bioweapon. The laboratory was later evacuated and destroyed by a [[Base Delta Zero]]&mdash;[[orbital bombardment]]&mdash;when the Empire lost control of the slither vines, leaving behind only ruins.<ref name="Paths Unknown" />

